1
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:18,000
He was left for dead. He would not forget.

2
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:30,000
Man in the Wilderness is a western, adventure, drama
film directed by Richard C. Sarafian.

3
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:42,000
In the early 1800s, a group of fur trappers and Indian traders are returning with their goods
to civilization and are making a desperate attempt to beat the oncoming winter.

4
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:54,000
When guide Zachary Bass is injured in a bear attack, they
decide he's a goner and leave him behind to die.

5
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:06,000
When he recovers instead, he swears revenge on them and tracks
them and their paranoiac expedition leader down.

6
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:18,000
Zachary Bass, played by Richard Harris.

7
00:36:24,000 --> 00:36:30,000
Captain Filmore Henry, played by John Huston.

8
00:41:36,000 --> 00:41:42,000
Indian Chief, played by Henry Wilcoxon.

9
00:46:48,000 --> 00:46:54,000
Fogarty, played by Percy Herbert.

10
00:52:00,000 --> 00:52:06,000
Grace, played by Prunella Ransome.

11
00:57:12,000 --> 00:57:18,000
Lowrie, played by Dennis Waterman.

12
01:02:24,000 --> 01:02:30,000
Man in the Wilderness is a 1971 American revisionist Western film about a scout for a group of
mountain men who are traversing the Northwestern United States during the 1820s.

13
01:07:36,000 --> 01:07:42,000
Scout Zachary Bass is mauled by a bear and left to die by his companions.

14
01:12:48,000 --> 01:12:54,000
He survives and recuperates sufficiently to track his former
comrades, forcing a confrontation over his abandonment.

15
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
The story is loosely based on the life of Hugh Glass.

16
01:23:12,000 --> 01:23:18,000
It stars Richard Harris as Zachary Bass and John
Huston as Captain Filmore Henry.

17
01:28:24,000 --> 01:28:30,000
The expedition in the movie is notable for bringing a
large boat with it, borne on wheels.

18
01:33:36,000 --> 01:33:42,000
The film explores themes of expedition, wilderness, native
american, based on true story, fur trapping.

19
01:38:48,000 --> 01:38:54,000
The tone is emotional.
